<title>USA: InPhyNet Medical mulling acquisitions.</title>
<headline>InPhyNet Medical mulling acquisitions.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LAUDERDALE, Fla. 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>InPhyNet Medical Management Inc said on Monday it is in talks to acquire the business of Gut Management Inc, Nudel &amp; Gluck M.D. and certain privately held businesses for an undisclosed amount.</p>
<p>The company said it hopes to announce an acquisition in the first quarter of 1997. InPhyNet provides physician practice management services through 193 contracts wifh hospital-based services and capitated networks.</p>
</text>
